    {
      "title": "As we Passed, I remarked",
      "excerpt": "As we passed, I remarked a beautiful church-spire rising above some old elms in the park; and before them, in the midst of a lawn, chimneys covered with ivy, and the windows shining in the sun.",
      "image": {
        "url": "https://wp.nkdev.info/squadforce/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/slide-11.jpg",
        "alt": "As we Passed, I remarked"
      },
      "linkUrl": null,
      "linkLabel": "Read More",
      "sortOrder": 1
    },
    {
      "title": "He made his passenger captain of one",
      "excerpt": "Now the races of these two have been for some ages utterly extinct, and besides to discourse any further of them would not be at all to my purpose. But the concern I have most at heart is for our Corporation of Poets, from whom I am preparing a petition to your Highness, to be subscribed with the names of one…",
      "image": {
        "url": "https://wp.nkdev.info/squadforce/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/slide-21.jpg",
